{"seq":1,"slug":"grpc-fundamentals","title":"gRPC 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/grpc-and-rpc/grpc-fundamentals","wordCount":615,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"grpc-基础\">gRPC 基础</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>gRPC 是 Google 开源的高性能 RPC（Remote Procedure Call）框架。与 REST 的&quot;资源&quot;抽象不同，gRPC 直接暴露<strong>服务方法</strong>——客户端像调用本地函数一样调用远程服务。它基于 HTTP/2 协议，使用 Protocol Buffers（Protobuf）作为接口定义语言和序列化格式，性能远超 JSON-based REST。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[客户端存根] --&gt;|HTTP/2| B[gRPC 服务器]&#10;    B --&gt; C[服务实现]&#10;    C --&gt; D[业务逻辑]&#10;    A -.-&gt;|.proto 文件| E[代码生成]&#10;    B -.-&gt;|.proto 文件| E&#10;    subgraph 契约驱动&#10;        E&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    A[客户端存根] --&gt;|HTTP/2| B[gRPC 服务器]\n    B --&gt; C[服务实现]\n    C --&gt; D[业务逻辑]\n    A -.-&gt;|.proto 文件| E[代码生成]\n    B -.-&gt;|.proto 文件| E\n    subgraph 契约驱动\n        E\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>REST/JSON</th>\n<th>gRPC/Protobuf</th>\n<th>GraphQL</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传输协议</td>\n<td>HTTP/1.1</td>\n<td>HTTP/2</td>\n<td>HTTP/1.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列化</td>\n<td>JSON（文本）</td>\n<td>Protobuf（二进制）</td>\n<td>JSON（文本）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td>快 5-10x</td>\n<td>与 REST 相当</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流式支持</td>\n<td>无原生支持</td>\n<td>四种流模式</td>\n<td>Subscription</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型安全</td>\n<td>无（依赖文档）</td>\n<td>强类型（代码生成）</td>\n<td>强类型（Schema）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浏览器支持</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n<td>需要 gRPC-Web</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可读性</td>\n<td>高（人类可读）</td>\n<td>低（二进制）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>公开 API</td>\n<td>内部微服务</td>\n<td>前端 BFF</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"服务定义与-proto-文件\">服务定义与 Proto 文件</h2><p>gRPC 的核心是 <code>.proto</code> 文件——它定义了服务的方法签名、请求/响应消息结构。所有客户端和服务端代码都从这个文件生成。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"protobuf\" data-code=\"syntax = &quot;proto3&quot;;&#10;&#10;package user.v1;&#10;&#10;option go_package = &quot;github.com/org/api/gen/user/v1&quot;;&#10;&#10;service UserService {&#10;  rpc GetUser(GetUserRequest) returns (GetUserResponse);&#10;  rpc ListUsers(ListUsersRequest) returns (ListUsersResponse);&#10;  rpc CreateUser(CreateUserRequest) returns (CreateUserResponse);&#10;  rpc UpdateUser(UpdateUserRequest) returns (UpdateUserResponse);&#10;  rpc DeleteUser(DeleteUserRequest) returns (DeleteUserResponse);&#10;  rpc WatchUsers(WatchUsersRequest) returns (stream UserEvent);&#10;}&#10;&#10;message User {&#10;  string id = 1;&#10;  string name = 2;&#10;  string email = 3;&#10;  UserRole role = 4;&#10;  google.protobuf.Timestamp created_at = 5;&#10;  google.protobuf.Timestamp updated_at = 6;&#10;}&#10;&#10;enum UserRole {&#10;  USER_ROLE_UNSPECIFIED = 0;&#10;  USER_ROLE_USER = 1;&#10;  USER_ROLE_ADMIN = 2;&#10;  USER_ROLE_MODERATOR = 3;&#10;}&#10;&#10;message GetUserRequest {&#10;  string id = 1;&#10;}&#10;&#10;message GetUserResponse {&#10;  User user = 1;&#10;}&#10;&#10;message ListUsersRequest {&#10;  int32 page_size = 1;&#10;  string page_token = 2;&#10;  string filter = 3;&#10;  string order_by = 4;&#10;}&#10;&#10;message ListUsersResponse {&#10;  repeated User users = 1;&#10;  string next_page_token = 2;&#10;  int32 total_count = 3;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>syntax = \"proto3\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>package user.v1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>option go_package = \"github.com/org/api/gen/user/v1\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>service UserService {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc GetUser(GetUserRequest) returns (GetUserResponse);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc ListUsers(ListUsersRequest) returns (ListUsersResponse);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc CreateUser(CreateUserRequest) returns (CreateUserResponse);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc UpdateUser(UpdateUserRequest) returns (UpdateUserResponse);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc DeleteUser(DeleteUserRequest) returns (DeleteUserResponse);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc WatchUsers(WatchUsersRequest) returns (stream UserEvent);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string name = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string email = 3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  UserRole role = 4;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  google.protobuf.Timestamp created_at = 5;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  google.protobuf.Timestamp updated_at = 6;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enum UserRole {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  USER_ROLE_UNSPECIFIED = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  USER_ROLE_USER = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  USER_ROLE_ADMIN = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  USER_ROLE_MODERATOR = 3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message GetUserRequest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message GetUserResponse {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  User user = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message ListUsersRequest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int32 page_size = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string page_token = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string filter = 3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string order_by = 4;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message ListUsersResponse {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  repeated User users = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string next_page_token = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int32 total_count = 3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>字段编号（<code>= 1</code>, <code>= 2</code>）是 Protobuf 的核心设计——序列化时用编号而不是字段名，这是它高性能的原因。编号一旦分配就不能修改，删除的字段编号应标记为 <code>reserved</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ProtoFieldRule {&#10;  rule: string;&#10;  reason: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const protoRules: ProtoFieldRule[] = [&#10;  { rule: &#39;字段编号不可修改&#39;, reason: &#39;二进制兼容性&#39; },&#10;  { rule: &#39;删除字段用 reserved&#39;, reason: &#39;防止编号重用&#39; },&#10;  { rule: &#39;枚举首值为 0 + UNSPECIFIED&#39;, reason: &#39;零值默认语义&#39; },&#10;  { rule: &#39;方法名用 PascalCase&#39;, reason: &#39;gRPC 约定&#39; },&#10;  { rule: &#39;消息名用 PascalCase&#39;, reason: &#39;Protobuf 约定&#39; },&#10;  { rule: &#39;字段名用 snake_case&#39;, reason: &#39;Protobuf 约定&#39; },&#10;  { rule: &#39;包名含版本号&#39;, reason: &#39;API 版本控制&#39; },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProtoFieldRule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  rule</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> protoRules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProtoFieldRule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { rule: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'字段编号不可修改'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'二进制兼容性'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { rule: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'删除字段用 reserved'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'防止编号重用'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { rule: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'枚举首值为 0 + UNSPECIFIED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'零值默认语义'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { rule: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'方法名用 PascalCase'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gRPC 约定'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { rule: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'消息名用 PascalCase'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Protobuf 约定'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { rule: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'字段名用 snake_case'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Protobuf 约定'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { rule: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'包名含版本号'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'API 版本控制'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"四种通信模式\">四种通信模式</h2><p>gRPC 支持四种通信模式，覆盖了所有远程调用场景：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[gRPC 通信模式] --&gt; B[Unary]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Server Streaming]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Client Streaming]&#10;    A --&gt; E[Bidirectional Streaming]&#10;    B --&gt; F[请求-响应]&#10;    C --&gt; G[服务端推送流]&#10;    D --&gt; H[客户端上传流]&#10;    E --&gt; I[双向实时通信]\">graph TD\n    A[gRPC 通信模式] --&gt; B[Unary]\n    A --&gt; C[Server Streaming]\n    A --&gt; D[Client Streaming]\n    A --&gt; E[Bidirectional Streaming]\n    B --&gt; F[请求-响应]\n    C --&gt; G[服务端推送流]\n    D --&gt; H[客户端上传流]\n    E --&gt; I[双向实时通信]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"protobuf\" data-code=\"service DataService {&#10;  // Unary: 请求-响应&#10;  rpc GetItem(GetItemRequest) returns (GetItemResponse);&#10;&#10;  // Server Streaming: 服务端流式返回&#10;  rpc ListItems(ListItemsRequest) returns (stream Item);&#10;&#10;  // Client Streaming: 客户端流式发送&#10;  rpc UploadFile(stream FileChunk) returns (UploadResponse);&#10;&#10;  // Bidirectional: 双向流&#10;  rpc Chat(stream ChatMessage) returns (stream ChatMessage);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>service DataService {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // Unary: 请求-响应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc GetItem(GetItemRequest) returns (GetItemResponse);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // Server Streaming: 服务端流式返回</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc ListItems(ListItemsRequest) returns (stream Item);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // Client Streaming: 客户端流式发送</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc UploadFile(stream FileChunk) returns (UploadResponse);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // Bidirectional: 双向流</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc Chat(stream ChatMessage) returns (stream ChatMessage);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>客户端</th>\n<th>服务端</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Unary</td>\n<td>1 请求</td>\n<td>1 响应</td>\n<td>CRUD 操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Server Streaming</td>\n<td>1 请求</td>\n<td>N 响应</td>\n<td>日志推送、数据导出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Client Streaming</td>\n<td>N 请求</td>\n<td>1 响应</td>\n<td>文件上传、批量导入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bidirectional</td>\n<td>N 请求</td>\n<td>N 响应</td>\n<td>聊天、实时协作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"错误处理与状态码\">错误处理与状态码</h2><p>gRPC 使用自己的状态码体系，而不是 HTTP 状态码。每个状态码有明确的语义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface GrpcStatus {&#10;  code: number;&#10;  name: string;&#10;  httpEquivalent: number;&#10;  usage: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const statusCodes: GrpcStatus[] = [&#10;  { code: 0, name: &#39;OK&#39;, httpEquivalent: 200, usage: &#39;成功&#39; },&#10;  { code: 3, name: &#39;INVALID_ARGUMENT&#39;, httpEquivalent: 400, usage: &#39;参数错误&#39; },&#10;  { code: 5, name: &#39;NOT_FOUND&#39;, httpEquivalent: 404, usage: &#39;资源不存在&#39; },&#10;  { code: 6, name: &#39;ALREADY_EXISTS&#39;, httpEquivalent: 409, usage: &#39;资源已存在&#39; },&#10;  { code: 7, name: &#39;PERMISSION_DENIED&#39;, httpEquivalent: 403, usage: &#39;权限不足&#39; },&#10;  { code: 8, name: &#39;RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED&#39;, httpEquivalent: 429, usage: &#39;配额耗尽&#39; },&#10;  { code: 13, name: &#39;INTERNAL&#39;, httpEquivalent: 500, usage: &#39;内部错误&#39; },&#10;  { code: 14, name: &#39;UNAVAILABLE&#39;, httpEquivalent: 503, usage: &#39;服务不可用&#39; },&#10;  { code: 16, name: &#39;UNAUTHENTICATED&#39;, httpEquivalent: 401, usage: &#39;未认证&#39; },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GrpcStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  httpEquivalent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  usage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> statusCodes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GrpcStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { code: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, name: </span><span style=\"